          "success": "The target's muscles become temporarily weaker. For 1 round, the target is enfeebled|CRB|enfeebled 2, and any time it attempts to take an action with the manipulate trait, the action is disrupted unless it succeeds at a flat check with a DC equal to 5 + its enfeebled value.",
